---
- op: replace
  path: /metadata/name
  value: mcp-hindsight-home
- op: add
  path: /spec/toolsOverride
  value:
    retain:
      description: >-
        Store a derived home-bank memory. NEVER retain credentials, raw tool
        outputs, file contents, or verbatim API responses; distill first. Tag
        consistently using existing tags (see list_tags).
    recall:
      description: >-
        Search home-bank memories. Prefer reflect for synthesized answers; use
        recall only when individual memory entries are needed.
